{"title": "Pact of the Blade: Maul", "pageid": 51870, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Pact_of_the_Blade:_Maul", "categories": ["Class actions", "Actions", "Item summoning actions", "Patch 8 content"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Pact_of_the_Blade_Maul.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0f/Pact_of_the_Blade_Maul.webp/300px-Pact_of_the_Blade_Maul.webp, /w/images/0/0f/Pact_of_the_Blade_Maul.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0f/Pact_of_the_Blade_Maul.webp/300px-Pact_of_the_Blade_Maul.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0f/Pact_of_the_Blade_Maul.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Pact of the Blade: Maul</b> is a class action available to <a href=\"/wiki/Hexblade\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Hexblade\">Hexblades</a> that selected the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Pact_of_the_Blade_(passive_feature)\" title=\"Pact of the Blade (passive feature)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Pact_of_the_Blade_passive_feature_Icon.webp/20px-Pact_of_the_Blade_passive_feature_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Pact_of_the_Blade_passive_feature_Icon.webp/30px-Pact_of_the_Blade_passive_feature_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Pact_of_the_Blade_passive_feature_Icon.webp/40px-Pact_of_the_Blade_passive_feature_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Pact of the Blade\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Pact_of_the_Blade_passive_feature_Icon.webp/20px-Pact_of_the_Blade_passive_feature_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Pact_of_the_Blade_passive_feature_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Pact_of_the_Blade_(passive_feature)\" title=\"Pact of the Blade (passive feature)\">Pact of the Blade</a> at level 3. It is a variation of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Pact_of_the_Blade\" title=\"Pact of the Blade\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5f/Pact_of_the_Blade_Icon.webp/20px-Pact_of_the_Blade_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5f/Pact_of_the_Blade_Icon.webp/30px-Pact_of_the_Blade_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5f/Pact_of_the_Blade_Icon.webp/40px-Pact_of_the_Blade_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Pact of the Blade\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5f/Pact_of_the_Blade_Icon.webp/20px-Pact_of_the_Blade_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5f/Pact_of_the_Blade_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Pact_of_the_Blade\" title=\"Pact of the Blade\">Pact of the Blade</a> that summons a new <a href=\"/wiki/Pactbound_Maul\" title=\"Pactbound Maul\">Pactbound Maul</a> to your hand.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Summon a maul. \n</p>\nYou are <a href=\"/wiki/Proficient\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Proficient\">Proficient</a> with the weapon. You can only have one at a time. The weapon disappears if you are more than 1.5 m (5 ft) away from it for more than 10 rounds.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/42px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a></dd>\n<dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: Self\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: Self</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Per combat\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: Per combat</dd></dl>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> UID</div>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: min-content auto; grid-gap: 6px; margin-left: 6px;\">  \n  <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Shout_PactOfTheBlade_Hexblade_Maul</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_PactOfTheBlade_Hexblade_Maul\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_PactOfTheBlade_Hexblade_Maul\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Item:_Pactbound_Maul\"> Item: Pactbound Maul </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"nomobile\"><figure class=\"mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Pactbound_Maul.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9f/Pactbound_Maul.png/180px-Pactbound_Maul.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9f/Pactbound_Maul.png/270px-Pactbound_Maul.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9f/Pactbound_Maul.png/360px-Pactbound_Maul.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9f/Pactbound_Maul.png/180px-Pactbound_Maul.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"180\" height=\"180\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9f/Pactbound_Maul.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure></div>\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Pactbound_Maul\" title=\"Pactbound Maul\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1d/Pactbound_Maul_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Pactbound_Maul_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1d/Pactbound_Maul_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Pactbound_Maul_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/1/1d/Pactbound_Maul_Unfaded_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1d/Pactbound_Maul_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Pactbound_Maul_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1d/Pactbound_Maul_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Pactbound_Maul\" title=\"Pactbound Maul\">Pactbound Maul</a></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;– <span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: Permanent\n</p>\n<div style=\"margin-top: 10px; margin-left: 20px\">\n    <dt>Damage: 2~12</dt><dd class=\"bg3wiki-damage-display\" style=\"margin-left:0px\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;width:fit-content\"><span style=\"display:block;position:relative;width:30px;height:30px;margin-left:0px;padding-top:0px;margin-right:2px\"><span style=\"z-index:0;position:absolute;transform:translate( 0%, 0%)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2b/D6_Physical.png/27px-D6_Physical.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2b/D6_Physical.png/40px-D6_Physical.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2b/D6_Physical.png/54px-D6_Physical.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2b/D6_Physical.png/27px-D6_Physical.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/2b/D6_Physical.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><div><div style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-bludgeoning\">2d6</span><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bludgeoning\" title=\"Bludgeoning\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bludgeoning\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Bludgeoning\" title=\"Bludgeoning\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-bludgeoning\">Bludgeoning</span></a></div></div></div></dd>\n  </div>\n<div style=\"margin-top: 10px; margin-left: 20px\">\n<b>Properties</b><div class=\"bg3wiki-horizontlist\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mauls\" title=\"Mauls\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d2/Mauls_Icon.png/25px-Mauls_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d2/Mauls_Icon.png/38px-Mauls_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d2/Mauls_Icon.png/50px-Mauls_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mauls\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d2/Mauls_Icon.png/25px-Mauls_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d2/Mauls_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Mauls\" title=\"Mauls\">Mauls</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/List_of_melee_weapons\" title=\"List of melee weapons\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2a/Melee_Range_Icon.png/25px-Melee_Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2a/Melee_Range_Icon.png/38px-Melee_Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/2/2a/Melee_Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Melee\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2a/Melee_Range_Icon.png/25px-Melee_Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2a/Melee_Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/List_of_melee_weapons\" title=\"List of melee weapons\">Melee</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Martial_weapons\" title=\"Martial weapons\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/17/Martial_Weapon_Prof_Icon.png/25px-Martial_Weapon_Prof_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/17/Martial_Weapon_Prof_Icon.png/38px-Martial_Weapon_Prof_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/17/Martial_Weapon_Prof_Icon.png/50px-Martial_Weapon_Prof_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Martial\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/17/Martial_Weapon_Prof_Icon.png/25px-Martial_Weapon_Prof_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/17/Martial_Weapon_Prof_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Martial_weapons\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Martial weapons\">Martial</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Two-Handed\" title=\"Two-Handed\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Handedness_Icon.png/25px-Handedness_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Handedness_Icon.png/38px-Handedness_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/b/ba/Handedness_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Two-handed\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Handedness_Icon.png/25px-Handedness_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Handedness_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Two-Handed\" title=\"Two-Handed\">Two-handed</a></li></ul>\n</div> \n<div class=\"bg3wiki-horizontlist\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 0 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  0           gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 4.5 kg (9 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 4.5 kg (9 lb)</li></ul>\n</div> \n</div> \n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Hexed_Weapon\"> Condition: Hexed Weapon </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hexed_Weapon_(Condition)\" title=\"Hexed Weapon (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6d/Pact_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Pact_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6d/Pact_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Pact_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6d/Pact_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Pact_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hexed Weapon\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6d/Pact_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Pact_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6d/Pact_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hexed_Weapon_(Condition)\" title=\"Hexed Weapon (Condition)\">Hexed Weapon</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: Permanent</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>The warlock bound to this weapon is always <a href=\"/wiki/Proficient\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Proficient\">Proficient</a> with it.</li>\n<li>The weapon's damage is magical and uses the warlock's <a href=\"/wiki/Charisma\" title=\"Charisma\">Charisma</a> modifier.</li>\n<li>When the warlock attacks with this weapon, there is a chance that <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hexblade%27s_Curse_(Condition)\" title=\"Hexblade's Curse (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/47/Generic_Ethereal_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Ethereal_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/47/Generic_Ethereal_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Ethereal_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/47/Generic_Ethereal_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Ethereal_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hexblade's Curse\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/47/Generic_Ethereal_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Ethereal_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/47/Generic_Ethereal_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hexblade%27s_Curse_(Condition)\" title=\"Hexblade's Curse (Condition)\">Hexblade's Curse</a> will be applied to the target.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\nClasses: <ul><li> Class level 3: <a href=\"/wiki/Hexblade\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Hexblade\">Hexblade</a> (via <a href=\"/wiki/Pact_of_the_Blade_(passive_feature)\" title=\"Pact of the Blade (passive feature)\">Pact of the Blade</a>)</li></ul>\n<p>This spell is a variation of:<br>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Pact_of_the_Blade\" title=\"Pact of the Blade\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5f/Pact_of_the_Blade_Icon.webp/40px-Pact_of_the_Blade_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5f/Pact_of_the_Blade_Icon.webp/60px-Pact_of_the_Blade_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5f/Pact_of_the_Blade_Icon.webp/80px-Pact_of_the_Blade_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Pact of the Blade\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5f/Pact_of_the_Blade_Icon.webp/40px-Pact_of_the_Blade_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5f/Pact_of_the_Blade_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Pact_of_the_Blade\" title=\"Pact of the Blade\">Pact of the Blade</a></span>\n</p>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>The <a href=\"/wiki/Weapon_action_DC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Weapon action DC\">weapon action DC</a> of the summoned Pact Weapon still uses <a href=\"/wiki/Strength\" title=\"Strength\">Strength</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">Dexterity</a> instead of <a href=\"/wiki/Charisma\" title=\"Charisma\">Charisma</a>.</li>\n<li>Unlike some other Pact of the Blade weapon summoning actions, this one is exclusive to <a href=\"/wiki/Hexblade\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Hexblade\">Hexblades</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715055451\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.105 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.111 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 4880/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 87863/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 35950/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 33/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 36/1000\nLua time usage: 0.033/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1529505/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n171.49%  159.839     61 Template:Trim\n100.00%   93.207      1 Template:Feature_page\n100.00%   93.207      1 -total\n 28.05%   26.142      1 Template:Item_box\n 22.64%   21.100      1 Template:Item_box/format_weapon\n 21.65%   20.180     13 Template:Icon_text\n 15.71%   14.646      1 Template:SmPass\n 12.66%   11.797      6 Template:Icon_link\n 10.80%   10.063      1 Template:Feature_page/technical_section\n  7.56%    7.050      2 Template:Hidden_code\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:51870-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715055451 and revision id 318641. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}